3. Test Cases
3.1 Video Playback
TC-001: Video Play/Pause
•	Description: Verify that videos can be played and paused
•	Prerequisites: Application is loaded, video is available
•	Test Steps:
i.	Click on a video card
ii.	Click the play button
iii.	Verify video starts playing
iv.	Click the pause button
v.	Verify video pauses
•	Expected Results: Video plays when play button is clicked and pauses when pause button is clicked
•	Actual Results: Video is not played when play button is clicked and not paused for pause button.
•	Status: Fail
TC-002: Volume Control
•	Description: Verify that volume can be adjusted
•	Prerequisites: Application is loaded, video is playing
•	Test Steps:
i.	Play a video
ii.	Adjust volume slider
iii.	Verify volume changes
iv.	Mute the video
v.	Verify video is muted
•	Expected Results: Volume changes when slider is adjusted, video mutes when mute button is clicked
•	Actual Results: Not able to verify since play button is not working.
•	Status: Unverified
TC-003: Playback Rate
•	Description: Verify that playback rate can be changed
•	Prerequisites: Application is loaded, video is playing
•	Test Steps:
i.	Play a video
ii.	Change playback rate to 1.5x
iii.	Verify video plays at 1.5x speed
iv.	Change playback rate to 0.5x
v.	Verify video plays at 0.5x speed
•	Expected Results: Video plays at the selected playback rate
•	Actual Results: Not able to verify since play button is not working
•	Status: Unverified
3.2 Search and Filter
TC-004: Search by Title
•	Description: Verify that videos can be searched by title
•	Prerequisites: Application is loaded
•	Test Steps:
i.	Enter a video title in the search box
ii.	Press Enter
iii.	Verify matching videos are displayed
•	Expected Results: Only videos with matching titles are displayed
•	Actual Results: Only videos with matching titles are displayed
•	Status: Pass
TC-005: Search by Tags
•	Description: Verify that videos can be searched by tags
•	Prerequisites: Application is loaded
•	Test Steps:
i.	Enter a tag in the search box
ii.	Press Enter
iii.	Verify videos with matching tags are displayed
•	Expected Results: Videos with matching tags are displayed
•	Actual Results: Videos with matching tags are displayed
•	Status: Pass
TC-006: Filter by Recent
•	Description: Verify that videos can be filtered by recency
•	Prerequisites: Application is loaded
•	Test Steps:
i.	Select "Recent" from the filter dropdown
ii.	Verify only recent videos are displayed
•	Expected Results: Only videos published in the last 30 days are displayed
•	Actual Results: Videos not displayed
•	Status: Fail
3.3 Bookmarks
TC-007: Add Bookmark
•	Description: Verify that bookmarks can be added
•	Prerequisites: Application is loaded, video is playing
•	Test Steps:
i.	Play a video
ii.	Click the bookmark button at a specific timestamp
iii.	Verify bookmark is added to the bookmark list
•	Expected Results: Bookmark is added with correct timestamp and title
•	Actual Results: Bookmark is added
•	Status: Pass
TC-008: Navigate to Bookmark
•	Description: Verify that clicking a bookmark navigates to the correct timestamp
•	Prerequisites: Application is loaded, bookmarks exist
•	Test Steps:
i.	Click on a bookmark in the bookmark list
ii.	Verify video jumps to the correct timestamp
•	Expected Results: Video jumps to the timestamp of the bookmark
•	Actual Results: Video does not jump to the timestamp of the bokmark
•	Status: Fail
3.4 Comments
TC-009: Add Comment
•	Description: Verify that comments can be added
•	Prerequisites: Application is loaded, video is selected
•	Test Steps:
i.	Enter a comment in the comment box
ii.	Click "Post Comment"
iii.	Verify comment appears in the comments list
•	Expected Results: Comment is added to the comments list
•	Actual Results: Comment is added to the comments list
•	Status: [Pass/Fail]
TC-010: Reply to Comment
•	Description: Verify that replies can be added to comments
•	Prerequisites: Application is loaded, comments exist
•	Test Steps:
i.	Enter a reply in the reply box
ii.	Click "Reply"
iii.	Verify reply appears under the comment
•	Expected Results: Reply is added under the comment
•	Actual Results: Reply is added
•	Status: Pass
3.5 Accessibility
TC-011: Keyboard Navigation
•	Description: Verify that all features can be accessed via keyboard
•	Prerequisites: Application is loaded
•	Test Steps:
i.	Use Tab key to navigate through the application
ii.	Use Enter key to activate buttons
iii.	Use arrow keys to adjust sliders
•	Expected Results: All features can be accessed and operated via keyboard
•	Actual Results: All features can be accessed
•	Status: Pass
TC-012: Screen Reader Compatibility
•	Description: Verify that screen readers can read all content
•	Prerequisites: Application is loaded, screen reader is active
•	Test Steps:
i.	Navigate through the application using screen reader
ii.	Verify all content is read correctly
•	Expected Results: Screen reader reads all content correctly
•	Actual Results: Screen reader reads all content correctly as expected
•	Status: Pass
3.6 Error Handling
TC-013: Network Error
•	Description: Verify that network errors are handled gracefully
•	Prerequisites: Application is loaded, network is disconnected
•	Test Steps:
i.	Disconnect from the internet
ii.	Try to play a video
iii.	Verify error message is displayed
•	Expected Results: Appropriate error message is displayed
•	Actual Results: Error message is not displayed
•	Status: Fail
TC-014: Invalid Input
•	Description: Verify that invalid inputs are handled correctly
•	Prerequisites: Application is loaded
•	Test Steps:
i.	Enter an invalid comment (empty or too long)
ii.	Click "Post Comment"
iii.	Verify error message is displayed
•	Expected Results: Appropriate error message is displayed
•	Actual Results: Error message is displayed for empty comment. Error message is not displayed for comment that is too long. (above 500 char)
•	Status: Fail
