7.2 Recommendations
.  Fix Sort State Persistence on Refresh
•	Ensure user-selected sort filters (e.g., rating, date) persist after refresh.
2. Resolve Broken Thumbnails on Network Disconnect
•	Implement fallback thumbnails or placeholders.
•	Show a “retry” icon or auto-retry logic when the network is restored.
3. Make Like Button Functional on Reply Comments
•	Add missing tap/click event listeners for nested comment elements.
4. Correct ‘Recent’ Filter Logic
•	Ensure newly added videos surface correctly at the top.
 5. Improve Offline Handling
•	Gracefully handle full/partial network disconnections.
•	Add offline indicators where feasible.
Long-term Improvements
UI Feedback for Actions
•	Add visual feedback (like animation or colour change) when a button is tapped, even before the backend confirms.

